Package: amd-gui
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: bong-water-water-bong <staff@amd-gui.dev>
Depends: libqt6core6, libqt6gui6, libqt6qml6, libqt6quick6,
 qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-controls,
 qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-window
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/bong-water-water-bong/AMD-gui
Description: Radeon Software for Linux
 Native Linux re-implementation of AMD Adrenalin (Radeon Software):
 GPU tuning (Overdrive), live performance metrics, game profiles,
 display settings, backed by amdgpu sysfs. Tuning writes need the
 video group + tmpfiles rule, installed by
 /usr/share/amd-gui/install-permissions.sh (run as root).
